{"name":"Blackish Grey","hex":"#5b5c61","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blackish","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["somewhat black"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blackish"},{"term":"grey","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Commonwealth standard spelling of gray.","Synonym of coloured (pertaining to the mixed race of black and white)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Commonwealth standard spelling of gray."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/grey"}],"entries":[{"title":"Black-ish","blocks":[{"text":"Black-ish is an American sitcom television series created by Kenya Barris. It aired on ABC from September 24, 2014, to April 19, 2022, running for eight seasons with 175 episodes. Black-ish follows an upper class well-off Black family headed by Andre \"Dre\" Johnson, a successful advertising executive, and his wife Rainbow \"Bow\", an anesthesiologist. The show revolves around the wealthy Johnson family as they juggle personal, familial and sociopolitical issues, particularly in trying to reconcile their desire to stay true to their Black identities with their choice to live in a wealthy, suburban white neighborhood."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black-ish","wikidata":"Q16868584"},{"title":"Grey","blocks":[{"text":"Grey or gray is an intermediate color between black and white. It is a neutral or achromatic color, meaning that it has no chroma. It is the color of a rain or storm cloud, of ash, and of lead."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Loxodonta_africana_by_Ron_Cogswell.jpg/330px-Loxodonta_africana_by_Ron_Cogswell.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grey","wikidata":"Q42519"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Grey_Longhaired_Female_Cat.jpg/330px-Grey_Longhaired_Female_Cat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaig